#!/bin/sh
# Point opkg at DockNeighbor OS's own signed package feed (level 1 for the dn-* packages; dn-pkg-upgrade).
# The key ships in /etc/opkg/keys/1c44072d07e3e228 with this package.
URL=https://github.com/DockNeighbor/DockNeighbor-OS/releases/download/feed
f=/etc/opkg/customfeeds.conf
touch "$f"
grep -q '^src/gz dn_os ' "$f" && sed -i '/^src\/gz dn_os /d' "$f"
echo "src/gz dn_os $URL" >> "$f"
